Attached are Environmental Notices regarding two new EPA regulations for
glycol dehydrators. One is for dehys on the pipeline from the well to the gas
processing plant (Oil & Gas Production MACT) and the other is for dehys
downstream of the gas plant on the transmission and underground storage
system (Transmission & Storage MACT).

Graham
